{"seq":3,"slug":"employment-unemployment-theory","title":"就业与失业理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/labor-demand-equilibrium/employment-unemployment-theory","wordCount":3032,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"就业与失业理论\">就业与失业理论</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>失业是劳动经济学中最具社会关切的议题。它不仅意味着产出损失和财政负担，更对失业者个人造成收入丧失、心理伤害和人力资本折旧等长期伤害。理解失业的成因——它究竟是市场效率的必要副产品，还是制度失灵的症状——对于设计有效的就业政策至关重要。</p>\n<p>经济学家对失业的理解经历了深刻演变：从古典学派&quot;自愿失业&quot;的视角，到 Keynes 的&quot;非自愿失业&quot;革命，再到 Friedman-Phelps 的自然失业率假说，直至当代搜寻理论对摩擦性失业的微观基础刻画。每一次理论进步都重新定义了政策干预的边界和目标。</p>\n<p>本文将系统梳理失业的分类与度量、主要的理论模型、自然失业率的决定因素，以及失业持续性（滞后效应）的解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>失业理论的演进可以理解为对&quot;失业是自愿还是非自愿&quot;这一问题的持续回答。古典学派视失业为工资过高的自愿结果，Keynes 强调总需求不足导致的非自愿失业，Friedman-Phelps 用自然失业率把长期锚定在结构性因素上，而搜寻理论则从劳动力市场的流量与匹配摩擦中给出了微观基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[失业的成因] --&gt; B[古典: 工资过高, 自愿]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Keynes: 总需求不足, 非自愿]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Friedman-Phelps: 自然失业率]&#10;    A --&gt; E[搜寻理论: 匹配摩擦]&#10;    D --&gt; F[摩擦性 + 结构性失业]&#10;    E --&gt; G[流量-存量动态与 Beveridge 曲线]&#10;    F --&gt; H[长期失业锚定]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{滞后效应?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[周期性失业转化为结构性失业]\">graph TD\n    A[失业的成因] --&gt; B[古典: 工资过高, 自愿]\n    A --&gt; C[Keynes: 总需求不足, 非自愿]\n    A --&gt; D[Friedman-Phelps: 自然失业率]\n    A --&gt; E[搜寻理论: 匹配摩擦]\n    D --&gt; F[摩擦性 + 结构性失业]\n    E --&gt; G[流量-存量动态与 Beveridge 曲线]\n    F --&gt; H[长期失业锚定]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{滞后效应?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[周期性失业转化为结构性失业]</pre><p>下表汇总本文的核心概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>理论意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然失业率</td>\n<td>长期中通胀稳定时的失业率</td>\n<td>长期失业的结构性锚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAIRU</td>\n<td>非加速通胀失业率</td>\n<td>货币政策盯住的临界水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beveridge 曲线</td>\n<td>空缺率与失业率的关系</td>\n<td>衡量匹配效率的指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞后效应</td>\n<td>周期性失业的持久化</td>\n<td>失业的自我强化机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积极劳动市场政策</td>\n<td>培训、补贴、职业匹配</td>\n<td>降低结构性失业的政策工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"失业的测量与分类\">失业的测量与分类</h2><h3 id=\"基本概念\">基本概念</h3><p>国际劳工组织（ILO）的标准失业定义要求同时满足三个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>没有工作</strong>：调查参考周内未从事任何有报酬的工作</li>\n<li><strong>可以工作</strong>：如果有合适的工作机会，能够在短期内开始工作</li>\n<li><strong>积极寻找工作</strong>：在最近的特定期间内采取了具体的求职行动</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>失业率</strong>定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u = \\frac{U}{L} = \\frac{U}{E + U}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 为失业人数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 为就业人数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = E + U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 为劳动力总量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐性失业与不充分就业\">隐性失业与不充分就业</h3><p>官方失业率低估了劳动市场的实际疲软程度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>沮丧工人</strong>（Discouraged Workers）：因多次求职失败而放弃寻找的人不算&quot;失业&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>不充分就业</strong>（Underemployment）：想全职工作但只找到兼职的人算&quot;就业&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>隐性失业</strong>：在低效率的国有部门或家庭农业中，边际产出为零但名义上&quot;有工作&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>美国劳工统计局（BLS）的 U-6 指标（包含沮丧工人和非自愿兼职）通常比 U-3（标准失业率）高 4-6 个百分点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"失业的分类\">失业的分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n<th>政策应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>摩擦性失业</td>\n<td>工人在工作转换间的临时失业</td>\n<td>信息不完全、搜寻需要时间</td>\n<td>短期（几周）</td>\n<td>改善信息匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构性失业</td>\n<td>技能/地理与需求不匹配</td>\n<td>产业转型、技术变革</td>\n<td>中长期（数月-数年）</td>\n<td>再培训、流动补贴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性失业</td>\n<td>经济衰退导致总需求不足</td>\n<td>宏观冲击</td>\n<td>随周期变化</td>\n<td>货币/财政政策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性失业</td>\n<td>季节性需求波动</td>\n<td>农业、旅游业的周期性</td>\n<td>规律性短期</td>\n<td>季节调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自然失业率\">自然失业率</h2><h3 id=\"friedman-phelps-假说\">Friedman-Phelps 假说</h3><p>Milton Friedman（1968）和 Edmund Phelps（1968）独立提出了<strong>自然失业率</strong>（Natural Rate of Unemployment）概念：即使经济处于长期均衡、通胀稳定时，仍存在的失业水平。它反映了摩擦性和结构性失业的总和。</p>\n<p>核心命题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>货币政策只能在<strong>短期</strong>内使失业偏离自然率（通过意外通胀&quot;欺骗&quot;工人）</li>\n<li><strong>长期</strong>中，预期调整后失业回归自然率——对应垂直的长期菲利普斯曲线</li>\n<li>试图永久将失业压低于自然率，只会导致加速通胀</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"nairu\">NAIRU</h3><p>非加速通胀失业率（Non-Accelerating Inflation Rate of Unemployment, NAIRU）是自然率的操作性对应物：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>↑</mo><mo>↑</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>通胀加速</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u &lt; u^{NAIRU} \\Rightarrow \\pi \\uparrow \\uparrow \\quad (\\text{通胀加速})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通胀加速</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>↓</mo><mo>↓</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>通胀减速</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u &gt; u^{NAIRU} \\Rightarrow \\pi \\downarrow \\downarrow \\quad (\\text{通胀减速})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓↓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通胀减速</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>π</mi><mtext> 稳定</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u = u^{NAIRU} \\Rightarrow \\pi \\text{ 稳定}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">稳定</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>NAIRU 不是固定的——它受劳动市场制度、人口结构和技术变化影响。OECD 国家的 NAIRU 估计差异巨大：美国约 4-5%，法国约 8-9%，日本约 3-4%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影响自然率的因素\">影响自然率的因素</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>实证方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>失业保险慷慨度</td>\n<td>延长搜寻时间</td>\n<td>替代率每增 10%，失业时间延长 1-2 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>就业保护法规</td>\n<td>降低流入率但也降低流出率</td>\n<td>效果不确定，可能提高长期失业占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工会密度</td>\n<td>推高工资、限制灵活性</td>\n<td>与更高失业率正相关（但协调型议价例外）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积极劳动市场政策</td>\n<td>改善匹配效率</td>\n<td>降低结构性失业约 0.5-1 百分点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人口年龄结构</td>\n<td>年轻工人失业率更高</td>\n<td>年轻人占比增加时自然率上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税楔（Tax Wedge）</td>\n<td>劳动成本与到手工资的差距</td>\n<td>高税楔国家失业率更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"失业流量分析\">失业流量分析</h2><h3 id=\"stocks-vs-flows\">Stocks vs. Flows</h3><p>失业率是一个存量指标，但背后是不断的流入和流出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{du}{dt} = s(1-u) - f \\cdot u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是工作分离率（separation rate），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是工作发现率（job-finding rate）。</p>\n<p>稳态失业率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^* = \\frac{s}{s + f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"美国的失业动态\">美国的失业动态</h3><p>Shimer（2012）分解了美国失业率波动的来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>工作发现率的波动</strong>解释了约 75% 的失业率变化</li>\n<li>分离率解释约 25%</li>\n<li>衰退期主要是找工作变难（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 下降），而非裁员增加（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上升）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这暗示政策应聚焦于促进再就业（改善匹配效率、提供搜寻援助），而不仅是防止裁员。</p>\n<h3 id=\"beveridge-曲线\">Beveridge 曲线</h3><p>贝弗里奇曲线描述了失业率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 与职位空缺率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的负相关关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = B(u), \\quad B&#x27;(u) &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>曲线的位置反映了劳动市场的<strong>匹配效率</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>曲线外移（向右上方移动）：同样的空缺率对应更高失业——匹配效率恶化（结构性问题）</li>\n<li>沿曲线移动：周期性波动（衰退时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 增加、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 减少）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2008 年金融危机后，美国贝弗里奇曲线明显外移——暗示技能错配或地理不匹配加剧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失业的持续性与滞后效应\">失业的持续性与滞后效应</h2><h3 id=\"hysteresis-假说\">Hysteresis 假说</h3><p>Blanchard 和 Summers（1986）提出的<strong>滞后效应</strong>（Hysteresis）假说认为：临时性的需求冲击可能导致失业率<strong>永久性</strong>上升。即使冲击消失，失业不会自动回到原来的自然率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滞后机制\">滞后机制</h3><p><strong>人力资本折旧</strong>：长期失业者的技能退化、工作习惯丧失、心理健康恶化，使其再就业能力下降。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（失业期间人力资本折旧）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{t+1} = (1 - \\delta_u)h_t \\quad \\text{（失业期间人力资本折旧）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（失业期间人力资本折旧）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>时间越长，折旧越严重——形成恶性循环。</p>\n<p><strong>内部人-外部人理论</strong>（Lindbeck &amp; Snower, 1988）：在职工人（内部人）拥有议价权力，在工资谈判中只关心自身就业——不会通过接受降薪来为失业者（外部人）创造就业机会。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>衰退中被裁的工人成为&quot;外部人&quot;</li>\n<li>恢复期，内部人利用其不可替代性要求恢复甚至提高工资</li>\n<li>均衡就业量可能永远无法恢复到冲击前</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>雇主歧视</strong>：企业将长期失业视为负面信号（&quot;为什么没人要他？&quot;），形成统计歧视。Kroft et al.（2013）的简历审计实验证实：在美国，失业超过 6 个月后，回调率急剧下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"欧洲的失业经历\">欧洲的失业经历</h3><p>欧洲（特别是法国、西班牙、意大利）在 1980 年代经历了失业率的阶梯式上升：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1970s 石油危机后失业率上升</li>\n<li>1980s 紧缩性货币政策进一步推高失业</li>\n<li>但 1990-2000s 经济恢复后，失业率未回到 1970s 水平</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这被广泛视为滞后效应的宏观证据。相比之下，美国劳动市场更灵活（更弱的就业保护、更短的失业保险期限），失业的持续性更低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失业的社会成本\">失业的社会成本</h2><h3 id=\"个体层面\">个体层面</h3><p>失业对个人的伤害远超收入损失：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>收入疤痕效应</strong>（Scarring Effect）：Jacobson et al.（1993）发现被裁员工人在 6 年后的收入仍比未被裁者低 25%</li>\n<li><strong>健康影响</strong>：Sullivan 和 von Wachter（2009）估计被裁员使次年死亡概率上升 50-100%</li>\n<li><strong>心理健康</strong>：失业与抑郁、焦虑、自杀率高度相关——且因果方向主要从失业到心理问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"社会层面\">社会层面</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>产出损失</strong>：Okun 定律 —— 失业率每高于自然率 1%，实际 GDP 低于潜在 GDP 约 2%</li>\n<li><strong>财政成本</strong>：失业保险支出 + 税收减少 + 社会服务成本</li>\n<li><strong>社会排斥</strong>：长期失业侵蚀社会网络、降低社区凝聚力、可能增加犯罪</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"积极劳动市场政策\">积极劳动市场政策</h2><h3 id=\"政策工具\">政策工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>有效性证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公共就业服务</td>\n<td>改善信息匹配、降低搜寻成本</td>\n<td>中等正面效果，成本效益比最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>培训项目</td>\n<td>提升失业者技能以匹配新需求</td>\n<td>长期正面但短期可能为负（锁定效应）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>就业补贴</td>\n<td>降低企业的有效雇佣成本</td>\n<td>对边际群体有效，但存在替代效应和无谓损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公共服务就业</td>\n<td>直接创造就业岗位</td>\n<td>短期缓解但长期向私营部门过渡率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创业支持</td>\n<td>促进自雇和小企业</td>\n<td>对筛选后的参与者有正面效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"card-et-al-2018-的元分析\">Card et al.（2018）的元分析</h3><p>Card、Kluve 和 Weber（2018）对 200+ 项积极劳动市场政策评估进行了元分析：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>短期</strong>（1 年内）：平均效果小且往往不显著</li>\n<li><strong>中期</strong>（2-3 年）：效果变为显著且经济上有意义（就业概率提高 5-10%）</li>\n<li><strong>人力资本密集型项目</strong>（培训）的中长期效果最好</li>\n<li><strong>公共服务就业</strong>的效果最差</li>\n<li>对长期失业者和女性的效果大于对青年和短期失业者</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>失业是一个多因素、多层次的现象。摩擦性失业是信息不完全市场的正常特征，结构性失业反映了经济转型的调整代价，而周期性失业则是总需求波动的产物。自然失业率的概念为政策设定了参照系——长期中，改善劳动市场的制度质量（而非简单地刺激总需求）是降低均衡失业率的根本途径。</p>\n<p>滞后效应的存在为宏观稳定政策提供了额外论据：如果放任深度衰退导致大规模长期失业，临时性冲击可能造成永久性伤害。因此，及时的反周期政策不仅减少短期痛苦，还可能避免自然率本身的恶化——预防的成本远低于事后修复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><p>失业理论是连接劳动经济学与宏观经济学的桥梁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../market-frictions-institutions/search-matching-model\">搜寻匹配模型</a>：本文提到的摩擦性失业，其微观基础正是下一章 DMP 搜寻匹配模型的核心贡献。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators/unemployment-and-labor-market\">失业与劳动力市场</a>：从宏观度量角度看失业率的定义、分类与统计口径，与本文的理论分类互为表里。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory/economic-cycle-and-fluctuation\">经济周期与波动</a>：周期性失业是总需求波动的产物，该篇给出经济周期的宏观成因分析。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../macroeconomics/monetary-and-fiscal-policy/interest-rate-and-monetary-transmission\">利率与货币传导</a>：本文讨论的反周期稳定政策，其货币政策工具如何影响就业，详见货币传导机制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"就业与失业理论","id":"就业与失业理论"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"失业的测量与分类","id":"失业的测量与分类"},{"level":3,"text":"基本概念","id":"基本概念"},{"level":3,"text":"隐性失业与不充分就业","id":"隐性失业与不充分就业"},{"level":3,"text":"失业的分类","id":"失业的分类"},{"level":2,"text":"自然失业率","id":"自然失业率"},{"level":3,"text":"Friedman-Phelps 假说","id":"friedman-phelps-假说"},{"level":3,"text":"NAIRU","id":"nairu"},{"level":3,"text":"影响自然率的因素","id":"影响自然率的因素"},{"level":2,"text":"失业流量分析","id":"失业流量分析"},{"level":3,"text":"Stocks vs. Flows","id":"stocks-vs-flows"},{"level":3,"text":"美国的失业动态","id":"美国的失业动态"},{"level":3,"text":"Beveridge 曲线","id":"beveridge-曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"失业的持续性与滞后效应","id":"失业的持续性与滞后效应"},{"level":3,"text":"Hysteresis 假说","id":"hysteresis-假说"},{"level":3,"text":"滞后机制","id":"滞后机制"},{"level":3,"text":"欧洲的失业经历","id":"欧洲的失业经历"},{"level":2,"text":"失业的社会成本","id":"失业的社会成本"},{"level":3,"text":"个体层面","id":"个体层面"},{"level":3,"text":"社会层面","id":"社会层面"},{"level":2,"text":"积极劳动市场政策","id":"积极劳动市场政策"},{"level":3,"text":"政策工具","id":"政策工具"},{"level":3,"text":"Card et al.（2018）的元分析","id":"card-et-al-2018-的元分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"工资决定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/labor-demand-equilibrium/wage-determination"},"next":{"title":"搜寻匹配模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/market-frictions-institutions/search-matching-model"}}